<report>
<title>Exact confidence limits for 2 by 2 odds</title>

<p>Input table:</p>
<table>
<tr><td><in>tab_a1</in></td><td><in>tab_b1</in></td></tr>
<tr><td><in>tab_a2</in></td><td><in>tab_b2</in></td></tr>
</table>

<p>Observed odds ratio = <inu>odds</inu></p>

<p>Conditional maximum likelihood estimate of odds ratio = <inu>eor</inu></p>

<p><ci>Exact Fisher <in>pc</in>% confidence interval = <inu>llf</inu>  to  <inu>ulf</inu></ci><br />
<pval>Exact Fisher one sided <inp>p1f</inp>, two sided <inp>p2f</inp></pval></p>

<p><ci>Exact mid-P <in>pc</in>% confidence interval = <inu>llm</inu>  to  <inu>ulm</inu></ci><br />
<pval>Exact mid-P one sided <inp>p1m</inp>, two sided <inp>p2m</inp></pval></p>
</report>